            <ArticleTitle>[Acupuncture therapy with TENS in chronic pain at the Neurologic Pain-Acupuncture Ambulatory Care Clinic of the Vienna Lainz Hospital].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>443-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>TENS therapy represents a good completion of chronic pain treatment, prolonging the effects of acupuncture and helping to overcome therapy resistance. Application for patients who are under Warfarin treatment and anxious of needles is obvious. Under the careful control of physicians TENS therapy is harmless. This report should be stimulating and enlarge knowledge of physicians specialized on pain treatment.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
